The libstdc++ shape of main.cpp (see test.desc): std::map<std::string,
value> and std::set<std::list<int>::iterator, cmp> instantiate _Rb_tree's
hidden friend operator< although nothing compares two containers; the
element comparisons it needs (stl_pair.h:835, predefined_ops.h:44) are
dropped.  Pre-existing (round-162 snapshot bin51).
